WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.920
Well Bailey, I am very
impressed with you, I really am.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.753
You seem like--
Thank you.

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:04.586
I really am.

00:00:04.586 --> 00:00:07.630
You seem like a very funny
and witty and cool person.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.890
You'd be the person, and
Sona back me up on this,

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.060
I would be talking to
Bailey a lot at the party.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.893
Yes.

00:00:12.893 --> 00:00:14.640
To the exclusion of other people

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.400
and we would both be trying to
out self-deprecate the other.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.233
Yes.

00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:20.780
And then afterwards it'd be
like, I really like Bailey.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:21.890
Bailey seemed cool.
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.100
I would.
Yeah.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.120
I appreciate that.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.930
I mean, I think it's
probably the Irish-Catholic,

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.370
you know, Boston heritage in us both.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.764
Oh, do you have heritage
back in Boston, do you think?

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:35.308
Well my dad's from Andover.
Oh God, that does it.

00:00:35.308 --> 00:00:39.766
Oh no!
Yes, it's just in the blood.

00:00:39.766 --> 00:00:41.038
Yeah, it's in the blood.

00:00:41.038 --> 00:00:42.500
Yeah, we'll just one up each other

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.944
by going down on like,
how bad we are as people.

00:00:45.944 --> 00:00:48.670
(laughs)
You might be related.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:49.940
Probably are.
Yeah.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.840
Probably are, you're
probably my third cousin

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.656
which makes your win illegal, by the way.

00:00:53.656 --> 00:00:54.489
[Bailey] Oh.

